{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "4858f9fe98d5bc7c658206054e1e660ec57b8aa7b4b789e434fdfeafa97a18c0", "ja": "むしだっておともだち！", "zh": "昆虫也是好朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3ef9156c0f38f3e0da642a4690eb70656482db4954812d46335e4f30da676e9c", "ja": "番組内のコーナー『たまきの虫すごーい！』\n収録のため、山へとやってきた環と杏奈。\n喜ぶ環と対照的に、虫が普通に苦手な杏奈は\n不安を覚える。しかし、ふたりで遊ぶことで\n杏奈は少しだけ虫の魅力を理解する。", "zh": "为了拍摄节目中的『环之虫虫好厉害～！』\n单元，环和杏奈来到山上。相较于开心\n的环，像普通人一样害怕昆虫的杏奈则是\n感到很不安。不过，在两人游玩的过程中，\n杏奈也稍微理解到了昆虫的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5a5bc8ac25a8661a4ab3b9022cd742c69b689de75941c08cec7b2d3e0b818989", "ja": "（今日は『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』内のコーナー、\n『たまきの虫すごーい！』の撮影で、山でのロケだ）", "zh": "（今天为了拍《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》的节目单元\n『环之虫虫好厉害～！』，来到山上出外景。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "288170179ded7d474644272b8492f7daf02bc33950bdbffd60ff78be63b0773a", "ja": "（コーナーの担当は、もちろん環！\nそしてアシスタント役は……）", "zh": "（担任单元主持人的，当然就是环了！\n而负责当助手的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "6c6657246235f64a4621c458ac8e29866dece7172888975890c6279b8d2edbcb", "ja": "うう……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "31f60e071ee3a10ffa307b5cac631c685de3b849602212f23e077fe73c1fb612", "ja": "たまき、このコーナーすっごく楽しみにしてたんだ！\nだって、虫といっぱい遊べるんでしょ？", "zh": "环期待拍这个单元很久了！\n因为可以跟昆虫一起玩，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "98dfe09b1dc77201aa783bd27190a2c0b3aa1fea023223189214dafb6aea544e", "ja": "環はやる気まんまんだな。\n杏奈は……、どうだ？", "zh": "环很有干劲呢。\n那杏奈……你怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "38a05b76a937613ae7ae5b0dd95cceff26fe9227740abde35eac9bb7750a3e80", "ja": "あの……、えと……。", "zh": "那个……呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4d7ea0dad9c203348b9f93168072a55e89ea040c3dc7b38acd8b4cee89349fa6", "ja": "ひょっとして、虫が苦手……とか？", "zh": "你该不会是……害怕昆虫吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "065a78b55dcf72f5a8753773d30ebec0d7209f0a13f2489c1e6aa865af163910", "ja": "得意な人……そんなに、いないと思う……。\n虫で、バトルするゲームは……、ぎりぎり……です。", "zh": "不会怕虫的人……应该也不多吧……\n杏奈最多只敢……玩用昆虫战斗的游戏……而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "4dc0d9bc552d58a4e880f808bef8aa85d197fc94c6b4da83be33636f78b9b6b4", "ja": "ええ～！？　虫は怖くないぞ！\nかわいいし、かっこいいんだぞ～！", "zh": "咦咦～！？昆虫才不可怕喔！\n牠们又可爱又帅喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "c6ae38e2fbec7157c1a20cbcf0510581c32d40b1b1417aa68741ffd3c3565daf", "ja": "かわいく、ない……。\nあんまり、かっこよくも……。", "zh": "才不可爱……\n也没有很帅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5890c85eff13a575efcf4a2e7135f42854860a1161e127d0963e678968c59e34", "ja": "（インドアな杏奈と、アウトドアな環。\n面白い組み合わせだと思ったんだが……）", "zh": "（偏好室内活动的杏奈，和喜爱户外活动的环。\n我本来想说可能会是有趣的组合，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a052030cfe28f25e918e487e6e4ee31b988b0541df16ccb58bb32e40add4788f", "ja": "よし。それじゃあ本番前にちょっとだけ、\nふたりで遊んでみたらどうだ？", "zh": "好，那在正式拍摄前，\n要不要你们两个先一起玩一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "a26a19286e56494b84e84435aa2c42270a81ba308ac587fc8e11beeb4e464776", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6e78605520963308cf7fc6b4e7eb3f4db120731b157752496f4e4dd532fea12d", "ja": "ああ、まずは杏奈が自然に慣れることが\n大事だからな。それに……なあ、杏奈。", "zh": "嗯，要先让杏奈熟悉大自然，这点很重要啊。\n而且……我跟你说，杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a226cb39f650e25adeb8eb85a86ada5811539577517ed55de7e47a8dedd795a4", "ja": "番組を見てる子ども達の中にも、\n杏奈みたいな子はいると思う。", "zh": "我想在看节目的小朋友当中，\n应该也有像杏奈一样怕虫的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5e9fe137b0fa8b2ed58bd829ce1b823378a3e926fe1f0925162f3ab83ac1eeee", "ja": "そんな子ども達の代表として、\n山遊びにチャレンジするつもりで……どうだ？", "zh": "你就当作是代表那些小朋友\n来挑战到山上玩……这样如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "adb4e9c1fc9fb8c327d73ffc0e50e974cb5dadcb4200b91fd96c107d55f0d22b", "ja": "ん……わかった……。\n杏奈、みんなのために……がんばり、ます。", "zh": "嗯……知道了……\n杏奈会为了大家……努力加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "8ce1e9bbe02e03827adf5b2318246ddd6a5be696a67aadc05fff675b5a8a2199", "ja": "でも……ダメだったら……\nレスキュー要請……出すね……？", "zh": "不过……如果真的不行……\n杏奈就会……请求救援喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c9c1d6dafdfc91bcf67eb0495672e5d0d3166e5e61a6c46dec8f90ce3a0cb1eb", "ja": "ああ、そしたら駆けつけるからな！\nおっかなびっくりでも、いろいろ触っておいで。", "zh": "当然，你求救了我就会马上赶过去的！\n害怕也没关系，试着多接触一些东西吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "707ad84e7b3f104c0a8276f4dd50a47a2a7bffba30f3a2d0226d3b325fd5416b", "ja": "あんなー！　ほら、これあげる！", "zh": "杏奈──！来，这个给你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "955f50e097f450960b76bf3b5f6305be7ca6aa961fd7448608b0767d9d69c52e", "ja": "ええと……木の枝……？\nこ、これ……どうする、の？", "zh": "呃……是树枝……？\n你、你为什么……要给这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "8b641869f67ee3c3f088b4569faf8e0ea34a8911ef1d5f6b07adbe56b289fcc9", "ja": "こんなふうに、じめっとした石をひっくり返して～。\n……いた！　この虫を、枝でつつくと……。", "zh": "像这样子，把湿湿的石头翻过来～\n……有了！用树枝戳戳看这只虫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "461499f777826d100d2b2b572a847b171ce43800a88e56590f68c6f404f8c1f5", "ja": "あっ……丸まった……。", "zh": "啊……牠卷起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "bf14a61a6de6c827b43e3ac813e94218ea5a6237fcb60f13755406e4010ebc56", "ja": "ね、かわいいでしょ！　くふふ♪", "zh": "你看，很可爱吧！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "963adc9eb3aa9f7a61d8db709fc3e6b9da3b75477613bba549a66f3dfb30590a", "ja": "ん……かわいい……かも。", "zh": "嗯……好像……有点可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "31b704989314e27ba6847bc2d970938a4e8132853bb6bdacdf5c0de2cac9664c", "ja": "あとね、ここに葉っぱがいっぱいあるでしょ？\nでも～、つっついてみたら……ほら！", "zh": "还有啊，这边不是有很多叶子吗？\n但只要戳戳看叶子……你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "f10877551c288e2e612cfd4d33e410437c34d53296af2575f42531b95837a91e", "ja": "！　飛んでった……。今の……蝶々？", "zh": "啊！飞走了……刚才那是……蝴蝶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "34eaafd8bef7276ee67a565ca3f3b0f7055444133d2a0f609af9092bd8cbeb16", "ja": "隠しアイテム、みたい……。\nこっちの葉っぱ、も……？", "zh": "好像隐藏道具一样……\n这边的叶子也是吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "bf82a4bde64317f342e315e432811b8c00c0dfc2c6f3e5902e45793f38d6f2e4", "ja": "（興味がわいてきたみたいだな。この調子なら……）", "zh": "（看来她开始有兴趣了呢，如果照这样下去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1030_staff", "source_sha256": "7c8755541905ec5cd985ce790ed81d29aebffea78dbcc7996d13ce2292b0f3ec", "ja": "オッケーです！　お疲れさまでしたー！", "zh": "OK！大家辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "8dbd74b425e284c25608a1e3b03f23f08c961fdb55e81d0b9d2ea0e8838935d4", "ja": "ひざ……ちょっと、すりむいたけど……\n虫……わりと平気、でした……。", "zh": "膝盖……虽然有点擦伤……\n但是……昆虫没有那么可怕呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "628ec6cec9695ef2b3da8baec6c071a7214f998ae9b67cffc3bc004d17e6115e", "ja": "環ちゃん……\nいろいろ……ありがとう♪", "zh": "小环……\n谢谢你……帮了杏奈这么多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "4534ee97faa65f14791d3fc561e32b665ef3ef6a68bca4a7d0424a812e1ae5c2", "ja": "たまきも、あんなと虫といっぱい遊べて、\nすっごく楽しかったぞ！", "zh": "环可以跟杏奈一起和昆虫玩，\n也超开心的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "4304e1fc65b46da21d489842dfb73f727e78c99f17690b1a3e7caefec51912c9", "ja": "お礼に、今度は杏奈が、\nゲーム……教える、ね。", "zh": "那杏奈下次……教你打电玩，\n当作谢礼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "24a0716ded53ff3f5d08def59983ccab1fadb433015ba3f45bb770f967ddfe7c", "ja": "ほんと！？　あんな、たまきの先生になってくれるの！\nうんっ、おしえておしえて！", "zh": "真的吗！？杏奈你愿意当环的老师呀！\n嗯，教教环吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "08ae5e7c7dd6bfc557605526e9c173a862d663dff89bcde7f4ee28b0f8807645", "ja": "ん……\nハイスコア、とれるまで……頑張ろ……♪", "zh": "嗯……\n一起努力……直到打出最高分吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1037_040tam", "source_sha256": "5a3a56bbf9df9bfe0d010664606e71f5f9544068e7a0a0ae69571866491e1d61", "ja": "はーい！　あ、じゃあお礼のお礼に、さっき見つけた、\nものすごく大きなウシガエル、捕まえてくるね！", "zh": "好～！啊，那为了谢谢你的谢礼，\n环去把刚才找到的超大牛蛙抓来送你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "9ee7a4fe2a7da7f8c01fd6fd68cca54e6573a45f213ce673d9111b75ce007fca", "ja": "そ、それは、いらない……。", "zh": "这、这就不用了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "bcf2b40a6ba774888573a1b3bb3f3bda1c8305332e69c92c00447fdb1925fcf5", "ja": "（全然違うふたりだけど、お互いの好きなことをして\n遊べば、きっと『好き』が広がっていく……）", "zh": "（虽然两人个性完全不同，但只要去体验彼此喜欢的\n事物，一起玩耍，一定可以扩展『喜好』的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1040_p", "source_sha256": "6c976b8d1bf87f41db2bf02e7cebd405c6fafdac08017e475c00618812050bb8", "ja": "（きっと、番組を見てる子ども達にも、\nそのメッセージは届くだろう……）", "zh": "（看了节目的孩子们，\n一定也会接收到这份讯息吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "85366ac96bd9ba1692f4cdcd8b062b510494cd917b4fe02ac4631fe22c2eb915", "ja": "……？\nなんだろ……？", "zh": "……？\n那是什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "7c9920b87fd2ca01350aeacb9975227c9f400d629d1d127780aabbfd7d036db3", "ja": "どうした、また虫でも見つけたのか？", "zh": "怎么了，你又找到了什么昆虫吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1043_024ann", "source_sha256": "c4a649ad728946482f792a1006374099e3a0be1190f720b9546fc50c8db282b6", "ja": "いま、空に……\n何か飛んで……。", "zh": "刚才天上……\n有东西在飞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1044_040tam", "source_sha256": "e02e16a74c85ae528bad425225531f04a84bc1df6636841b48a813939c19bbd3", "ja": "ほんと！？　何の虫！？", "zh": "真的吗！？是什么虫啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1045_024ann", "source_sha256": "d2d352dc2ce85496bad45244ac67b098d7e13c961d4ef5818625f0a192434f19", "ja": "ううん、虫じゃなくて……\nずっと、遠くの空で……。", "zh": "不对，不是昆虫……\n在天上很远很远的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1046_024ann", "source_sha256": "6548d2c3aebeca48b86b3a7d2839fdacc53ddd3ff7bcb3f1775bf5462d9ab333", "ja": "あの……メカっぽかった……です。", "zh": "呃……它看起来，很像是机械……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1047_040tam", "source_sha256": "5024c6d22067f7b2a5db324f6883bfc635519e0072fba86d19e06fb7291f3e2e", "ja": "メカ……？", "zh": "机械……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "77b8ec26f5a782754e2d81497d95b6cecdc5a08856ac1a9e061dd0f49200b782", "ja": "（メカ……？）", "zh": "（机械……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
